{"connection_id": "BC-5e6983e48f836163e957", "ref": "SBLGNT:Col.1.10", "target": "sec7", "tradition": "incil", "kind": "motif", "basis": "bearing fruit in good work", "note": "The prayer asks that believers bear fruit in every good work; this directly resonates with the commentary's righteous deeds and its image of a productive worker."}
{"connection_id": "BC-6bc9700c36081f9a54bc", "ref": "SBLGNT:Col.1.10", "target": "sec7", "tradition": "incil", "kind": "motif", "basis": "worthy walk bearing good work's fruit", "note": "The commentary joins a right road to effective work; the letter asks believers to walk worthily while bearing fruit in every good work."}
{"connection_id": "BC-a055e78afda45ff58817", "ref": "SBLGNT:Col.1.11", "target": "sec7", "tradition": "incil", "kind": "motif", "basis": "strength for endurance and patience", "note": "The next verse asks for strength to endure and be patient; it explicitly joins good work with the source's ṣabr."}
{"connection_id": "BC-facd381c7795f94cae9d", "ref": "SBLGNT:Eph.2.10", "target": "sec7", "tradition": "incil", "kind": "motif", "basis": "created for good works", "note": "The next verse says believers are created in Christ for good works prepared for them; it reconnects faith and action while making works the result of grace."}
