{"connection_id": "BC-6a7e6604bdfa1b46bcc4", "ref": "WLC:1Kgs.19.7", "target": "sec7", "tradition": "tevrat", "kind": "motif", "basis": "journey too great for traveler", "note": "The commentary imagines a traveler weakened by the way; Elijah is fed because the coming journey is too much for him without provision."}
